.TH "tangsible-run" "1" "2026-09-05" "Tangsible" "Tangsible Manual"
.PP
.SH NAME
.PP
tangsible-run - run a playbook with a live, navigable tree UI
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBtangsible run\fR [\fIplaybook.\&yml\fR] [--start-at-play \fIname\fR] [\fIansible-playbook args\fR .\&.\&.\&]
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBrun\fR starts \fIplaybook.\&yml\fR under \fBansible-playbook\fR(1) and shows its progress
as a live tree of plays → tasks → hosts, updating incrementally as the run
proceeds.\& Any trailing arguments are passed straight through to
\fBansible-playbook\fR unchanged.\&
.PP
.SH ADDITIONAL OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--start-at-play\fR \fIname\fR
.RS 4
Starts executing the playbook at the given play.\& Will only work with the playbook'\&s top-level plays, not with play pulled in via \fBimport_playbook\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH KEY BINDINGS
.PP
\fBUp/Down, Page Up/Down, CTRL-B/F, Home/End, CTRL-A/E\fR
.RS 4
Move the cursor (stops autoscrolling).\& Or scroll the active tab when
showing a host'\&s full results.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBF\fR
.RS 4
Resume autoscrolling to the newest row.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBLeft / Right\fR
.RS 4
Collapse / expand the task under the cursor.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBE / C\fR
.RS 4
Expand / collapse every task at once.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBn / N\fR
.RS 4
Jump to the next / previous task.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBf\fR
.RS 4
Open the filter dialog: All / Interesting / Changed / Failed.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB/\fR
.RS 4
Search filter (task name, source, and output).\&
.PP
.RE
\fBEnter\fR
.RS 4
Toggle a task'\&s host rows, or open a host'\&s full result if the cursor is on one.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBTab / Shift-Tab\fR
.RS 4
Switch tabs.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBr\fR
.RS 4
Open the rerun dialog, once the run has finished.\& See \fBtangsible-rerun\fR(1) for what it does.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBd\fR
.RS 4
Open the diff picker: choose a previous run to compare this one against.\& Requires at least one other completed run recorded in \fI.\&tangsible/state.\&toml\fR; otherwise this key does nothing.\& See \fBtangsible-revisit\fR(1), whose own list picker this reuses.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBEsc\fR
.RS 4
Close dialog or host'\&s full results.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBq / Ctrl-C\fR
.RS 4
While the playbook is still running, interrupt it (forwarded as \fBSIGINT\fR, exactly as pressing Ctrl-C on a plain \fBansible-playbook\fR invocation would).\& Once it has finished, quit.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.PP
See \fBtangsible\fR(1).\&
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBtangsible\fR(1), \fBansible-playbook\fR(1), \fBtangsible-rerun\fR(1), \fBtangsible-role\fR(1), \fBtangsible-revisit\fR(1)
